// Walking up to a clue reads it: the next fragment of its kind goes into the journal. Clues you don't
// reach stay unread, and the journal survives a save and load.
map
############################################
#..........................................#
#..........................................#
#..@.......................................#
############################################
end
clue 1 Note 8 0
clue 1 Relic 14 0
clue 1 Carving 36 0
expect 2 journal == 0
expect 2 clues == 3
hold 3-60 right
expect 90 journal == 2
expect 90 clues == 1               // the carving at the far end is still unread
saveload 95
expect 100 journal == 2
